:"83:10","t":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers,","j":30,"h":59,"s":83,"a":10,"sd":null},{"k":"83:11","t":"Who deny the Day of Recompense.","j":30,"h":59,"s":83,"a":11,"sd":null},{"k":"83:12","t":"And none deny it except every sinful transgressor.","j":30,"h":59,"s":83,"a":12,"sd":null},{"k":"83:13","t":"When Our verses are recited to him, he says, \"Legends of the former peoples.\"","j":30,"h":59,"s":83,"a":13,"sd":null},{"k":"83:14","t":"No! Rather, the stain has covered their hearts of that which they were earning.","j":30,"h":59,"s":83,"a":14,"sd":null},{"k":"83:15","t":"No! Indeed, from their Lord, that Day, they will be partitioned.","j":30,"h":59,"s":83,"a":15,"sd":null},{"k":"83:16","t":"Then indeed, they will [enter and] burn in Hellfire.","j":30,"h":59,"s":83,"a":16,"sd":null},{"k":"83:17","t":"Then it will be said [to them], \"This is what you used to deny.\"","j":30,"h":59,"s":83,"a":17,"sd":null},{"k":"83:18","t":"No! Indeed, the record of the righteous is in ʿilliyyūn.","j":30,"h":59,"s":83,"a":18,"sd":null},{"k":"83:19","t":"And what can make you know what is ʿilliyyūn?","j":30,"h":59,"s":83,"a":19,"sd":null},{"k":"83:20","t":"It is [their destination recorded in] a register inscribed","j":30,"h":59,"s":83,"a":20,"sd":null},{"k":"83:21","t":"Which is witnessed by those brought near [to Allāh].","j":30,"h":59,"s":83,"a":21,"sd":null},{"k":"83:22","t":"Indeed, the righteous will be in pleasure","j":30,"h":59,"s":83,"a":22,"sd":null},{"k":"83:23","t":"On adorned couches, observing.","j":30,"h":59,"s":83,"a":23,"sd":null},{"k":"83:24","t":"You will recognize in their faces the radiance of pleasure.","j":30,"h":59,"s":83,"a":24,"sd":null},{"k":"83:25","t":"They will be given to drink [pure] wine [which was] sealed.","j":30,"h":59,"s":83,"a":25,"sd":null},{"k":"83:26","t":"The last of it is musk. So for this let the competitors compete.","j":30,"h":59,"s":83,"a":26,"sd":null},{"k":"83:27","t":"And its mixture is of Tasneem,","j":30,"h":59,"s":83,"a":27,"sd":null},{"k":"83:28","t":"A spring from which those near [to Allāh] drink.","j":30,"h":59,"s":83,"a":28,"sd":null},{"k":"83:29","t":"Indeed, those who committed crimes used to laugh at those who believed.","j":30,"h":59,"s":83,"a":29,"sd":null},{"k":"83:30","t":"And when they passed by them, they would exchange derisive glances.","j":30,"h":59,"s":83,"a":30,"sd":null},{"k":"83:31","t":"And when they returned to their people, they would return jesting.","j":30,"h":59,"s":83,"a":31,"sd":null},{"k":"83:32","t":"And when they saw them, they would say, \"Indeed, those are truly lost.\"","j":30,"h":59,"s":83,"a":32,"sd":null},{"k":"83:33","t":"But they had not been sent as guardians over them.","j":30,"h":59,"s":83,"a":33,"sd":null}],"juz":30,"hizb":59,"surahs":[83],"sajdah":false}